  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It is designed to address the urgent need for increased investment in prevention and resilience, solidarity, and a renewed social contract, as highlighted in the UNDP 2022 Special Report on Human Security. It adopts a people centered, context-specific, and prevention-oriented approach to build community resilience, empower youth, and prevent violent extremism while strengthening social cohesion in Central Asia. Building on the successful outcomes of the 2018-2021 project at the community level,</narrative>
  </description>
